<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Pagamento Pix - Aether</title>
    <style>
        body { background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #0d1b2a 0%, #050a0f 100%); color: white; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
        .payment-card { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); width: 450px; padding: 40px; border-radius: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 162, 255, 0.3); text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .qr-container { background: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .qr-code { width: 200px; height: 200px; display: block; }
        .btn-back { background: transparent; color: #aaa; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid #444; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 10px; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-back:hover { color: white; border-color: white; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="payment-card">
        <h2 style="color: #00a2ff;">Confirmação de Compra</h2>
        <p>Você está adquirindo <b><%= cashAmount %> moedas</b></p>
        <p>Valor: <b>R$ <%= (cashAmount/1000).toFixed(2) %></b></p>
        <div class="qr-container">
            <img class="qr-code" src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data=AETHER_PIX_<%= cashAmount %>">
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 30px;">Escaneie o código acima para pagar.</p>
        <a href="/shop" class="btn-back">← Voltar para a Loja</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
